{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966330/extras/a3a77a03af8cffb8dfe41cac9f3bbb5e.avif?t=1769729542\" width=780 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>You take on the role of a part-time worker at a paper-processing company, where your job is as repetitive as it is essential: check documents, box them, and move on to the next. But this isn't just another mind-numbing shift\u2014the protagonist suffers from a disorder that causes frequent, random memory loss. Routine tasks are a constant struggle, and each day is a battle to remember even the simplest steps.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>When you\u2019re hired by a paper company promising stability, you quickly sense all is not as it seems. The lights flicker, colleagues act strangely, and gaps in your memory make details of the job\u2014and the dark secrets of the workplace\u2014difficult to piece together. Gradually, you realize something sinister is happening beneath the surface of ordinary office life.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966330/extras/770555c81a2475e5e5fc11b673a8f479.avif?t=1769729542\" width=780 height=164 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform paper task while keeping the anomaly away from the shore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take Painkillers to avoid the illusions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together clues to banish the anomaly and save your soul</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve random paperwork anomalies: identify and correct corrupted or \u201cimpossible\u201d documents before they strengthen the anomaly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage scarce resources: ration painkillers, coffee, or other meds, each with side effects that can alter perception or memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966330?t=1769729542","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966330/e167e94ebe6ed4b54490a221a424133bb8222c9e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769729542","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966330/69539d0f9a0eca164be97f31b61bdd3b55436116/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769729542","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966330/69539d0f9a0eca164be97f31b61bdd3b55436116/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769729542","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Turn Notifications","id":32},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains drug/alcohol, self-harm. These are classified as mature content in my game"},"detailed_description":"<h1>Mature Content Description</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The developers describe the content like this:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game contains disturbing imagery, drug references, moments of self harm, and strong language</i></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966330/extras/a3a77a03af8cffb8dfe41cac9f3bbb5e.avif?t=1769729542\" width=780 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>You take on the role of a part-time worker at a paper-processing company, where your job is as repetitive as it is essential: check documents, box them, and move on to the next. But this isn't just another mind-numbing shift\u2014the protagonist suffers from a disorder that causes frequent, random memory loss. Routine tasks are a constant struggle, and each day is a battle to remember even the simplest steps.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>When you\u2019re hired by a paper company promising stability, you quickly sense all is not as it seems. The lights flicker, colleagues act strangely, and gaps in your memory make details of the job\u2014and the dark secrets of the workplace\u2014difficult to piece together. Gradually, you realize something sinister is happening beneath the surface of ordinary office life.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966330/extras/770555c81a2475e5e5fc11b673a8f479.avif?t=1769729542\" width=780 height=164 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform paper task while keeping the anomaly away from the shore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take Painkillers to avoid the illusions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together clues to banish the anomaly and save your soul</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve random paperwork anomalies: identify and correct corrupted or \u201cimpossible\u201d documents before they strengthen the anomaly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage scarce resources: ration painkillers, coffee, or other meds, each with side effects that can alter perception or memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","developers":["Arlodev"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28